//! **The two axes E1's split left open -- MINTED**: dests parametricity over an
//! ABSTRACT body (`ir_bdst_*`) and the module axis keyed on the outcome class
//! (`ir_mexto_*`). Statements settled in `designs/2026-09-25-e1-axes.md`.
